# Action Tray — a "+" button opens a floating bottom tray that walks through three steps (Heading 1→2→3) with layout transitions and a springing content height; it closes by its x, the backdrop, a drag down past 100 pt, or finishing the steps.
# What this test covers: open/close via the rotating "+" (backdrop tap), the tray's own close button, all three
# steps with entering/exiting layout animations and the final "Accept 2" closing (step resets to Heading 1), a
# short drag down that springs back, a long drag that closes, an upward drag (clamped to -50), rapid Continue
# taps that race the layout transitions, and toggling while the open spring is mid-flight.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/action-tray"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 800
# Open, then close via the backdrop (covers the "+").
press 201 537
wait 800
wait "text" "Heading 1" 3000
press 201 300
wait 800
# Open and close with the tray's own x.
press 201 537
wait 800
press 355 672
wait 800
# Walk all three steps.
press 201 537
wait 800
press "text=\"Continue\""
wait "text" "Heading 2" 3000
wait 700
press "text=\"Accept 1\""
wait "text" "Heading 3" 3000
wait "text" "reactiive.io/demos" 3000
wait 700
# Accept 2 closes the tray and resets to step 0.
press "text=\"Accept 2\""
wait 1000
wait "text" "Heading 1" 3000
# Reopen: short drag down springs back, upward drag is limited, long drag closes.
press 201 537
wait 900
gesture pan 200 680 0 60 400
wait 800
gesture pan 200 680 0 -150 400
wait 800
gesture pan 200 660 0 180 400
wait 1000
# Rapid Continue taps racing the layout transitions.
press 201 537
wait 800
press "text=\"Continue\""
wait 150
press 201 795
wait 150
press 201 795
wait 1500
# Toggle while the open spring is mid-flight (second tap lands on the backdrop).
press 201 537
wait 120
press 201 300
wait 1000
press 201 537
wait 900
press 201 300
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
